  "content": "<h1>Superflat 維度</h1>\n<p>Superflat Dimension 將 Superflat 世界類型作為獨立維度加入。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/8SpfTsnq/images/504704d46f18ce5831b1aa41d3e50b38dab0f95d.png\" alt=\"預覽圖\"></p>\n<h2>使用方式</h2>\n<p>要進入 Superflat 維度，請用黑曜石建造傳送門框架，且在框架的兩個上角放置草方塊、兩個下角放置泥土，如下所示：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7332a7349f41af41d29264d3bde5a000a7fd706c.png\" alt=\"Superflat 維度傳送門\"></p>\n<h2>相容性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Create</strong> 擴充套件： <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252f2f4ngcAb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: 整合Portal</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>問題</h2>\n<p>目前沒有新的相容性或錯誤回報。如有問題，請至 <a href=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-superflatdimension/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 提交回報以便修正。</p>\n<h2>支援版本</h2>\n<p>🟩 26.1-26.2 / 🟩 1.21.1 / 🟥 1.21-1.21.11 / 🟩 1.20.1 / 🟪 1.16.5 / 🟪 1.12.2</p>\n<p>🟩 已支援<br>\n🟥 已停止支援<br>\n🟨 開發中<br>\n🟪 考慮支援</p>\n<h2>備註</h2>\n<p>歡迎在整合包、影片、直播或其他媒體中使用本模组。若喜愛此模组，財務上的支持將令我感激不盡。</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/github-plural_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 GitHub 上看到我\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fmahmudindev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/available/modrinth_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Modrinth 上找到我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@oreno69\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/youtube-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"觀看我在 YouTube 的內容\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/cuYgFmq3kz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/discord-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Discord 與我聊天\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mahmudindes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/donate/patreon-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252foreno\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/donate/kofi-singular-alt_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsaweria.co%252fmahmudindes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/barraIhsan/devins-badges/blob/saweria/assets/compact-minimal/donate/saweria-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Saweria 上支持我\"></a></div>\n<p><br></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dimensionfixer\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionfixer/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/dimensionfixer/icon.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Dimension Fixer\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dimensionlink\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionlink/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/dimensionlink/icon.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Dimension Link\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/worldportal\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-worldportal/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/worldportal/icon.png?raw=true\" alt=\"World Portal\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fMiqj0P3U\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-vanillaworld/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/vanillaworld/icon.png?raw=true\" alt=\"原版世界\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/morecatvariants\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-morecatvariants/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/morecatvariants/icon.png?raw=true\" alt=\"更多貓咪變體\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/passengersportalfix\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-passengersportalfix/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/passengersportalfix/icon.png?raw=true\" alt=\"乘客傳送門修復\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/createportalintegration\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-createportalintegration/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/createportalintegration/icon.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Create: 整合Portal\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a></div>",
